@InterProc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230
@csrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value

### Get setup status and the CSRF request token
GET {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/setup-status
Accept: application/json

### Register and sign in the first user (Admin)
POST {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Sign in
POST {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Get the current account
GET {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Sign out
POST {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

###
